  "text": {
    "status": "generated",
    "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Histopathology, colonoscopy biopsy of the caecum, for Ned LIVERPOOL. Adenocarcinoma. Loss of nuclear expression of MLH1 and PMS2; MSH2 and MSH6 retained.</p><p>Supplementary report: MLH1 promoter hypermethylation not detected (North West GLH, T23-55120). The loss of MLH1 and PMS2 may be due to Lynch syndrome; referral for germline testing (R210) is recommended.</p></div>"
  },
